{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华说：“那时，犹大王、首领、祭司、先知及耶路撒冷居民的骸骨都要从坟墓中被取出来，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["抛散在他们昔日恋慕、供奉、追随、求问、祭拜的日月星辰之下，无人收殓和埋葬，他们好像地上的粪便。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我要把这邪恶民族的余民流放到各地，他们在那里必痛不欲生。这是万军之耶和华说的。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和华吩咐我对犹大人说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“人跌倒后难道不站起来吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人走错了路难道不回头吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么耶路撒冷的居民一味地背叛我？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们诡诈成性，不肯回头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我仔细听，没有人说实话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有人为自己的恶行后悔，说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我做了可怕的事！’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人一意孤行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像战马直奔战场。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天空的鹳鸟尚且知道来去的季节，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斑鸠、燕子和白鹤也遵守迁徙的时间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的子民却不知道耶和华的法则。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“你们怎能说，‘我们有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我们有耶和华的律法’？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诚然，律法教师撒谎的笔把律法篡改了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智者必蒙羞辱，受惊吓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被捉拿。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，他们既弃掉耶和华的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哪里还有智慧可言呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要把他们的妻子交给别人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他们的田地交给新主人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们无论尊卑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"个个贪图不义之财；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无论是先知还是祭司，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都行为诡诈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们敷衍了事地医治我子民的伤痛，说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘没事了，没事了！’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其实情况很糟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们做可憎的事会羞愧吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不！他们不知廉耻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不脸红。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他们要与灭亡的人一同灭亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要在我惩罚之时覆灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要彻底灭绝他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄树不结葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无花果树不结果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"树叶也要枯干，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所赐给他们的都要被夺走。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"他们说：“我们为什么还坐在这里？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大家一起进入坚城，死在那里吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们的上帝耶和华要毁灭我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"给我们毒水喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我们得罪了祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们期待平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却没有祥和；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴望得到医治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却饱受惊吓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"“从但传来敌人战马的鼻息声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的骏马嘶鸣，震动大地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要来吞灭这片土地和地上的一切、城邑和居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"“看啊，我要派毒蛇去咬你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"法术无法制服它们。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我有无限忧愁，伤心欲绝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听啊！远处传来我同胞的哀鸣：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“难道耶和华不在锡安了吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道她的王不在她那里了吗？”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“他们为什么供奉雕刻的神像和外族无用的偶像，惹我发怒？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说：“麦收已完，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夏季已过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我们还未得救。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我为同胞的创伤而伤心，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我痛苦万分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惊慌失措。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道基列没有药物吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道那里没有医生吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么我同胞的创伤至今未愈？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}